{
  "episode": "ep01",
  "title": "日本の歴史、ここから始まる!〜縄文・弥生・古墳〜",
  "gaps": {
    "beat": 0.3,
    "scene": 0.6,
    "section": 0.8,
    "tail": 0.6
  },
  "total_duration": 806.541,
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "s01",
      "section": "opening",
      "start": 0.0,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s01_b00.wav",
          "start": 0.0,
          "duration": 4.811,
          "text": "ねえ先生、昔の人って本当にお米を食べてなかったの？"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s01_b01.wav",
          "start": 5.111,
          "duration": 8.251,
          "text": "実は、その「お米」こそが、日本の歴史を変えたんです!その理由は、本編で順番に見ていきましょう。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s01_b02.wav",
          "start": 13.662,
          "duration": 3.131,
          "text": "よし、縄文からスタートだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s02",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 17.593,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s02_b00.wav",
          "start": 17.593,
          "duration": 3.931,
          "text": "先生!最初の時代って、どんな時代なの?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s02_b01.wav",
          "start": 21.824,
          "duration": 5.771,
          "text": "何万年も前の氷河の時代には、もう日本に人が住んでいました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s02_b02.wav",
          "start": 27.895,
          "duration": 2.251,
          "text": "これが旧石器時代です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s02_b03.wav",
          "start": 30.446,
          "duration": 4.531,
          "text": "土器がまだ無いので、先土器時代と呼ぶこともあるんですよ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s02_b04.wav",
          "start": 35.277,
          "duration": 4.611,
          "text": "ふぇ?食器が無いと、ごはんはどうしてたの?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s02_b05.wav",
          "start": 40.188,
          "duration": 5.371,
          "text": "まだ煮込みはできないので、焼いたり生で食べたりしていたようです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s02_b06.wav",
          "start": 45.859,
          "duration": 5.011,
          "text": "道具は、石を打ち欠けて作る打製石器。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s02_b07.wav",
          "start": 51.17,
          "duration": 4.091,
          "text": "ナイフのように使って動物を狩っていました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s02_b08.wav",
          "start": 55.561,
          "duration": 4.091,
          "text": "旧石器って、古い石をあつめて作ったの?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s02_b09.wav",
          "start": 59.951,
          "duration": 4.291,
          "text": "いいえ、石を打ち欠けて道具を作るんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s02_b10.wav",
          "start": 64.542,
          "duration": 3.051,
          "text": "古い石を集めるわけじゃないんですよ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s02_b11.wav",
          "start": 67.893,
          "duration": 2.571,
          "text": "石のナイフ、かっこいい!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 71.064,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s03_b00.wav",
          "start": 71.064,
          "duration": 4.731,
          "text": "やがて氷河が解けて気候がぐんと暖かくなり、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s03_b01.wav",
          "start": 76.095,
          "duration": 5.331,
          "text": "大きく見て約1万年前から、縄文時代が始まります。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s03_b02.wav",
          "start": 81.726,
          "duration": 2.251,
          "text": "くらしはどう変わるの?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s03_b03.wav",
          "start": 84.277,
          "duration": 4.131,
          "text": "森と海のめぐみが増えて、狩りや釣り、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s03_b04.wav",
          "start": 88.708,
          "duration": 3.931,
          "text": "木の実採りで安定して暮らせるようになったんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s03_b05.wav",
          "start": 92.939,
          "duration": 6.451,
          "text": "道具も進化します。石を磨いて作る磨製石器の登場です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s03_b06.wav",
          "start": 99.69,
          "duration": 4.371,
          "text": "矢じりを磨いた弓矢で、イノシシなどを狩りました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s03_b07.wav",
          "start": 104.361,
          "duration": 3.411,
          "text": "打製から磨製へ、石の進化だ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s03_b08.wav",
          "start": 108.072,
          "duration": 4.291,
          "text": "そのとおり。時代が変わると、道具も変わる。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s03_b09.wav",
          "start": 112.663,
          "duration": 2.411,
          "text": "わかりやすい証拠なんですよ。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 115.674,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s04_b00.wav",
          "start": 115.674,
          "duration": 4.291,
          "text": "縄文時代のイメージといえば、もようのついた壺だ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s04_b01.wav",
          "start": 120.265,
          "duration": 3.491,
          "text": "鋭いですね!それが縄文土器。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s04_b02.wav",
          "start": 124.056,
          "duration": 3.051,
          "text": "紐を巻いた棒で転がして、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s04_b03.wav",
          "start": 127.407,
          "duration": 3.891,
          "text": "縄のもようを付けたことが名前の由来なんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s04_b04.wav",
          "start": 131.598,
          "duration": 2.691,
          "text": "しかも驚きなのですが、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s04_b05.wav",
          "start": 134.589,
          "duration": 4.771,
          "text": "縄文土器は世界でいちばん古い土器のひとつなんですよ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s04_b06.wav",
          "start": 139.66,
          "duration": 5.851,
          "text": "青森では約1万6500年前の土器も見つかっています。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s04_b07.wav",
          "start": 145.811,
          "duration": 4.331,
          "text": "日本の土器が世界最古級だ!?すごい!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s04_b08.wav",
          "start": 150.442,
          "duration": 3.171,
          "text": "土器で煮込み料理ができるようになって、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s04_b09.wav",
          "start": 153.913,
          "duration": 5.011,
          "text": "くらしがぐっと豊かになり、村での定住も進みました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s04_b10.wav",
          "start": 159.224,
          "duration": 5.851,
          "text": "縄文土器=世界最古級、煮込み料理で定住。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s04_b11.wav",
          "start": 165.375,
          "duration": 3.371,
          "text": "このつながり、おぼえておくと便利です。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 169.345,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s05_b00.wav",
          "start": 169.345,
          "duration": 3.451,
          "text": "縄文の人は、どんな家に住んでいたの?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s05_b01.wav",
          "start": 173.096,
          "duration": 5.811,
          "text": "地面に穴を掘って、周りに柱を立てる竪穴住居です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s05_b02.wav",
          "start": 179.207,
          "duration": 4.251,
          "text": "半分地下のような、暖かくて丈夫な家なんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s05_b03.wav",
          "start": 183.758,
          "duration": 3.771,
          "text": "冬も暖かそうだ!夏も涼しいの?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s05_b04.wav",
          "start": 187.829,
          "duration": 1.771,
          "text": "ええ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s05_b05.wav",
          "start": 189.9,
          "duration": 5.691,
          "text": "しかも数十軒の家が円形に並ぶ環状集落が、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s05_b06.wav",
          "start": 195.891,
          "duration": 2.331,
          "text": "各地で見つかっているんですよ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s05_b07.wav",
          "start": 198.522,
          "duration": 4.411,
          "text": "みんなで丸くなって暮らしてる!キャンプ場みたいだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s05_b08.wav",
          "start": 203.233,
          "duration": 3.131,
          "text": "仲間と集まって暮らすことで、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s05_b09.wav",
          "start": 206.664,
          "duration": 3.331,
          "text": "長く同じ場所に住めるようになったんです。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s06",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 210.595,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s06_b00.wav",
          "start": 210.595,
          "duration": 3.091,
          "text": "縄文の人は、毎日なにをしてたの?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s06_b01.wav",
          "start": 213.986,
          "duration": 4.531,
          "text": "弓矢で狩りをし、釣り針や銛で漁をして、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s06_b02.wav",
          "start": 218.817,
          "duration": 3.651,
          "text": "森と海のめぐみを上手に食べていました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s06_b03.wav",
          "start": 222.768,
          "duration": 3.611,
          "text": "食べた貝がらが積もってできた貝塚は、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s06_b04.wav",
          "start": 226.679,
          "duration": 3.291,
          "text": "当時のくらしを知る大事な遺跡です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s06_b05.wav",
          "start": 230.27,
          "duration": 2.691,
          "text": "ごみの山が、タイムカプセルだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s06_b06.wav",
          "start": 233.261,
          "duration": 5.811,
          "text": "土で作った土偶は、呪術やまじないに使われたと考えられています。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s06_b07.wav",
          "start": 239.372,
          "duration": 5.931,
          "text": "青森の三内丸山遺跡のような大きな集落もありました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s06_b08.wav",
          "start": 245.603,
          "duration": 4.051,
          "text": "遺跡を見ると、むかしの人の毎日が見えてくる!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s07",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 250.254,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s07_b00.wav",
          "start": 250.254,
          "duration": 3.451,
          "text": "先生、次の時代は、大ニュースだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s07_b01.wav",
          "start": 254.005,
          "duration": 4.491,
          "text": "紀元前10世紀ごろ、いまから約3000年前、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s07_b02.wav",
          "start": 258.796,
          "duration": 6.011,
          "text": "大陸から稲作と金属器が伝わってきて、弥生時代が始まります。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s07_b03.wav",
          "start": 265.107,
          "duration": 3.251,
          "text": "お米!ついに米の時代だ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s07_b04.wav",
          "start": 268.658,
          "duration": 6.491,
          "text": "水稲農業は、暖かくて湿った平原や低地で始まりました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s07_b05.wav",
          "start": 275.448,
          "duration": 4.691,
          "text": "水路を作り、村人みんなで田んぼを耕します。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s07_b06.wav",
          "start": 280.439,
          "duration": 4.451,
          "text": "ところでマナブ、お米が増えると何が増えると思う?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s07_b07.wav",
          "start": 285.19,
          "duration": 1.851,
          "text": "人が増える!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s07_b08.wav",
          "start": 287.341,
          "duration": 1.291,
          "text": "そのとおり!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s07_b09.wav",
          "start": 288.932,
          "duration": 6.691,
          "text": "縄文は動いて食べ物を探したけれど、弥生は米を作って定住。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s07_b10.wav",
          "start": 295.923,
          "duration": 3.891,
          "text": "その結果、人口も集落も増えたんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s07_b11.wav",
          "start": 300.114,
          "duration": 3.211,
          "text": "農業が日本の歴史のエンジンだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s07_b12.wav",
          "start": 303.625,
          "duration": 4.971,
          "text": "そのとおり。ここから日本は農業社会なんですよ。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s08",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 309.196,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s08_b00.wav",
          "start": 309.196,
          "duration": 3.971,
          "text": "弥生の村には、高ーい建物があるの!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s08_b01.wav",
          "start": 313.467,
          "duration": 2.451,
          "text": "それ、高床倉庫です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s08_b02.wav",
          "start": 316.218,
          "duration": 6.091,
          "text": "床を高く上げて、大切なお米を雨やネズミから守る倉庫なんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s08_b03.wav",
          "start": 322.609,
          "duration": 3.051,
          "text": "ネズミ先輩、お米は上げちゃダメだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s08_b04.wav",
          "start": 325.96,
          "duration": 4.891,
          "text": "鍋や壺などの弥生土器は、縄文のものより薄くて硬く、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s08_b05.wav",
          "start": 331.151,
          "duration": 1.971,
          "text": "煮炊きに向いていました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s08_b06.wav",
          "start": 333.422,
          "duration": 3.451,
          "text": "道具も石から鉄へ進んでいきます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s08_b07.wav",
          "start": 337.173,
          "duration": 5.371,
          "text": "お米と鉄と土器。村の力がどんどんついていく時代なんですよ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s08_b08.wav",
          "start": 342.844,
          "duration": 3.531,
          "text": "村がパワーアップだ!それからどうなったの?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s09",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 346.975,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s09_b00.wav",
          "start": 346.975,
          "duration": 4.571,
          "text": "でも先生、お米が増えると、けんかも増えちゃうの?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s09_b01.wav",
          "start": 351.846,
          "duration": 1.411,
          "text": "そのとおり。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s09_b02.wav",
          "start": 353.557,
          "duration": 4.971,
          "text": "お米や土地をめぐる争いが始まり、村は身を守るため、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s09_b03.wav",
          "start": 358.828,
          "duration": 4.731,
          "text": "周りに深い濠を掘った環濠集落になりました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s09_b04.wav",
          "start": 363.859,
          "duration": 4.091,
          "text": "日本で戦争が始まったのはこのころ、なんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s09_b05.wav",
          "start": 368.25,
          "duration": 5.051,
          "text": "ふぇ?戦争が始まったのは、この時代からなの…?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s09_b06.wav",
          "start": 373.601,
          "duration": 6.371,
          "text": "そうなんです。お祭りに使う銅鐸、武器の銅剣もこのころのもの。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s09_b07.wav",
          "start": 380.271,
          "duration": 4.571,
          "text": "村を率いる力の強い豪族も現れました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s09_b08.wav",
          "start": 385.142,
          "duration": 6.451,
          "text": "時は流れて紀元後3世紀、西日本をまとめる大きな国、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s09_b09.wav",
          "start": 391.893,
          "duration": 2.411,
          "text": "邪馬台国が登場します。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s09_b10.wav",
          "start": 394.604,
          "duration": 2.411,
          "text": "ついに本に出てくるやつだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s09_b11.wav",
          "start": 397.315,
          "duration": 7.691,
          "text": "邪馬台国の女王、卑弥呼は239年、中国の魏に使者を送りました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s09_b12.wav",
          "start": 405.306,
          "duration": 5.131,
          "text": "この記録が中国の歴史書、魏志倭人伝なんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s09_b13.wav",
          "start": 410.737,
          "duration": 3.931,
          "text": "卑弥呼!歴史のスーパースターだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s09_b14.wav",
          "start": 414.968,
          "duration": 6.571,
          "text": "さらに古い記録では、紀元57年に九州の奴国の王が、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s09_b15.wav",
          "start": 421.839,
          "duration": 6.251,
          "text": "漢の皇帝から漢委奴国王という金印をもらったことも書かれています。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 428.69,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s10_b00.wav",
          "start": 428.69,
          "duration": 4.931,
          "text": "ついに古墳時代だ!古墳って、大きなお墓なの?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s10_b01.wav",
          "start": 433.921,
          "duration": 1.371,
          "text": "そのとおり。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s10_b02.wav",
          "start": 435.592,
          "duration": 6.811,
          "text": "3世紀の中ごろから、力の強い豪族たちが巨大なお墓を作り始めます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s10_b03.wav",
          "start": 442.703,
          "duration": 4.291,
          "text": "これが古墳で、この時代を古墳時代と呼びます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s10_b04.wav",
          "start": 447.294,
          "duration": 2.811,
          "text": "お墓が、山みたいに大きくなるの!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s10_b05.wav",
          "start": 450.405,
          "duration": 7.371,
          "text": "特徴的なのが、丸と四角をつなげた、鍵穴型のお墓。前方後円墳です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s10_b06.wav",
          "start": 458.076,
          "duration": 4.771,
          "text": "船の形に似ている、という説明も有名なんですよ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s10_b07.wav",
          "start": 463.147,
          "duration": 3.851,
          "text": "上から見ると、船が海を走ってるみたいだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s10_b08.wav",
          "start": 467.298,
          "duration": 5.211,
          "text": "これだけの土を盛れるのは、多くの人を動かせる力があるから。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s10_b09.wav",
          "start": 472.809,
          "duration": 6.531,
          "text": "大和地方を中心に力を広げた豪族たち、つまり大和政権なんです。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 479.94,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s11_b00.wav",
          "start": 479.94,
          "duration": 3.851,
          "text": "古墳のまわりに立ってる、土の人形はなんなの?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s11_b01.wav",
          "start": 484.091,
          "duration": 5.931,
          "text": "それは埴輪。古墳の周りに並べた、素焼きの土製品なんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s11_b02.wav",
          "start": 490.322,
          "duration": 3.291,
          "text": "はにわだ!お顔がユニークだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s11_b03.wav",
          "start": 493.913,
          "duration": 6.291,
          "text": "家や馬、武人など、色々な形があって、お墓を守ったり、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s11_b04.wav",
          "start": 500.504,
          "duration": 3.091,
          "text": "儀式に使ったりしたと考えられています。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s11_b05.wav",
          "start": 503.894,
          "duration": 4.411,
          "text": "お墓の中には銅鏡や剣が納められていて、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s11_b06.wav",
          "start": 508.605,
          "duration": 2.971,
          "text": "亡くなった人の力を示しています。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s11_b07.wav",
          "start": 511.876,
          "duration": 3.251,
          "text": "馬のはにわ、走ってるみたいで好きだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 515.727,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s12_b00.wav",
          "start": 515.727,
          "duration": 3.451,
          "text": "大和政権は、どこまで大きくなったの?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s12_b01.wav",
          "start": 519.478,
          "duration": 5.971,
          "text": "各地の豪族と手を結び、鉄をもとめて朝鮮半島とも交わる、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s12_b02.wav",
          "start": 525.749,
          "duration": 2.651,
          "text": "大きな勢力に成長します。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s12_b03.wav",
          "start": 528.7,
          "duration": 2.731,
          "text": "鉄は、道具にも武器にも必要だ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s12_b04.wav",
          "start": 531.731,
          "duration": 5.211,
          "text": "大阪の大山古墳は、仁徳天皇陵古墳とも呼ばれます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s12_b05.wav",
          "start": 537.242,
          "duration": 6.531,
          "text": "全長約480メートル、日本最大の前方後円墳なんですよ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s12_b06.wav",
          "start": 544.073,
          "duration": 6.011,
          "text": "480メートル?東京タワーより長いの!?お墓なのに!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s12_b07.wav",
          "start": 550.384,
          "duration": 3.531,
          "text": "まさに巨大な力のシンボルなんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s12_b08.wav",
          "start": 554.215,
          "duration": 4.611,
          "text": "大山古墳は、おおやまこふんと読みますよ。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 559.426,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s13_b00.wav",
          "start": 559.426,
          "duration": 3.251,
          "text": "古墳時代の終わりごろは、どうなってたの?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s13_b01.wav",
          "start": 562.977,
          "duration": 6.611,
          "text": "5世紀になると、大和政権の王たちは、中国の王朝に使者を送ります。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s13_b02.wav",
          "start": 569.888,
          "duration": 5.251,
          "text": "史書に名が残る五人の王を、倭の五王と呼ぶんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s13_b03.wav",
          "start": 575.439,
          "duration": 3.251,
          "text": "海を渡って、世界進出だ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s13_b04.wav",
          "start": 578.99,
          "duration": 3.851,
          "text": "この交流を通じて漢字も伝わり、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s13_b05.wav",
          "start": 583.141,
          "duration": 3.491,
          "text": "日本にも文字の文化が芽生えていきます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s13_b06.wav",
          "start": 586.932,
          "duration": 5.011,
          "text": "日本史は次に、文字と仏教と大改革の時代へ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s13_b07.wav",
          "start": 592.243,
          "duration": 3.371,
          "text": "それが第2話のお楽しみです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s13_b08.wav",
          "start": 595.914,
          "duration": 3.011,
          "text": "あと少し!ポイントまとめ、お願い!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "section": "points",
      "start": 599.725,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s14_b00.wav",
          "start": 599.725,
          "duration": 5.651,
          "text": "ここからは、受験ポイントのまとめです!まずは旧石器と縄文。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s14_b01.wav",
          "start": 605.676,
          "duration": 4.491,
          "text": "旧石器時代は打製石器で土器なし。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s14_b02.wav",
          "start": 610.466,
          "duration": 7.051,
          "text": "縄文時代は磨製石器、縄文土器=世界最古級、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s14_b03.wav",
          "start": 617.817,
          "duration": 5.211,
          "text": "竪穴住居、環状集落、そして貝塚。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s14_b04.wav",
          "start": 623.328,
          "duration": 2.331,
          "text": "このセットを完璧に!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s14_b05.wav",
          "start": 625.959,
          "duration": 5.211,
          "text": "打製と磨製、どっちが先?と聞かれても、もう迷いませんね。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "section": "points",
      "start": 631.77,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s15_b00.wav",
          "start": 631.77,
          "duration": 5.331,
          "text": "続いて弥生と古墳。今日のいちばんの狙いどころです!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s15_b01.wav",
          "start": 637.401,
          "duration": 7.851,
          "text": "弥生時代は水稲農業=暖かく湿った平原・低地、高床倉庫、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s15_b02.wav",
          "start": 645.552,
          "duration": 9.571,
          "text": "環濠集落=戦争のはじまり、銅鐸=祭り、銅剣=武器。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s15_b03.wav",
          "start": 655.423,
          "duration": 6.731,
          "text": "そして239年、邪馬台国の女王・卑弥呼が魏に遣使。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s15_b04.wav",
          "start": 662.454,
          "duration": 6.011,
          "text": "古墳時代は前方後円墳、埴輪、大和政権。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s15_b05.wav",
          "start": 668.765,
          "duration": 3.851,
          "text": "時代とワードの対応を完璧に仕上げましょう!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "section": "quiz",
      "start": 673.416,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s16_b00.wav",
          "start": 673.416,
          "duration": 5.211,
          "text": "それでは今日の仕上げ、クイズタイム!第一問!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s16_b01.wav",
          "start": 678.927,
          "duration": 6.171,
          "text": "縄文時代に使われ始めた、石を磨いて作る石器は何でしょう?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s16_b02.wav",
          "start": 685.398,
          "duration": 8.331,
          "text": "ア、打製石器。イ、磨製石器。ウ、銅鐸。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s16_b03.wav",
          "start": 694.029,
          "duration": 2.571,
          "text": "えいっ、イだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s16_b04.wav",
          "start": 696.9,
          "duration": 4.411,
          "text": "正解!石を磨くから磨製石器。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s16_b05.wav",
          "start": 701.611,
          "duration": 7.651,
          "text": "旧石器=打製、縄文以降=磨製、ペアでしっかりね。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "section": "quiz",
      "start": 709.862,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s17_b00.wav",
          "start": 709.862,
          "duration": 1.371,
          "text": "第二問!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s17_b01.wav",
          "start": 711.533,
          "duration": 5.851,
          "text": "239年、魏に使者を送った邪馬台国の女王はだれでしょう?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s17_b02.wav",
          "start": 717.684,
          "duration": 7.451,
          "text": "ア、卑弥呼。イ、神功皇后。ウ、推古天皇。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s17_b03.wav",
          "start": 725.435,
          "duration": 3.531,
          "text": "歴史のスーパースター、アだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s17_b04.wav",
          "start": 729.266,
          "duration": 6.171,
          "text": "正解!卑弥呼です。記録したのは魏志倭人伝。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s17_b05.wav",
          "start": 735.737,
          "duration": 4.371,
          "text": "239年とセットで丸暗記しましょう。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "section": "quiz",
      "start": 740.708,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s18_b00.wav",
          "start": 740.708,
          "duration": 1.371,
          "text": "ラスト問題!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s18_b01.wav",
          "start": 742.379,
          "duration": 6.171,
          "text": "弥生時代、大切なお米を雨やネズミから守るために建てた建物は?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s18_b02.wav",
          "start": 748.849,
          "duration": 7.171,
          "text": "ア、竪穴住居。イ、高床倉庫。ウ、五重塔。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s18_b03.wav",
          "start": 756.32,
          "duration": 2.611,
          "text": "ネズミ対策といえば、イだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s18_b04.wav",
          "start": 759.231,
          "duration": 7.691,
          "text": "正解!高床倉庫です。高い床の上で、お米をしっかり守りました。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "section": "ending",
      "start": 767.722,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s19_b00.wav",
          "start": 767.722,
          "duration": 3.251,
          "text": "今日は旧石器から古墳まで、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s19_b01.wav",
          "start": 771.273,
          "duration": 3.411,
          "text": "日本史のはじまりを駆け足で見てきました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s19_b02.wav",
          "start": 774.984,
          "duration": 4.051,
          "text": "打製・磨製、縄文土器、水稲農業、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s19_b03.wav",
          "start": 779.335,
          "duration": 5.891,
          "text": "卑弥呼239年、前方後円墳、埴輪…"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration_unified/s19_b04.wav",
          "start": 785.526,
